 550   beta_ENER5_1(ene5,j,z)       Share parameter (CES - ENER composite)
 551   beta_ENER5_2(ene6,j,z)       Share parameter (CES - ENER composite)
 552   delta(z)                     Depreciation rate of capital in country z
 553   eta                          Price elasticity of indexed transfers and parameters
 554   frisch(z)                    Frisch parameter (LES function)
 555   gamma_GVT(i,z)               Share of commodity i in total current public expenditures on goods and services
