 600   tmrg(i,ij,zj,z)              Rate of margin i applied to commodity ij imported from country zj
 601   TnDShare(z)                  T&D share of Aggregated electricity
 602   PowerShare(z)                Power Industries share of Aggregated electricity
 603   theta2(j,i,z)                Export share of composite activity
 604   TOT_POP(z,time)              Total population from 1980 to 2050 based on the PEP w aggregation
 605   g_GDP(z,time)                GDP past and projected growth rate
 606   g_LS(z,time)                 Active population past and projected growth rate
 607   g_POP(z,time)                Population past and projected growth rate
 608   g_SDR(z,time)                Growth rate of domestic savings rate
 609   gamma_GVT(i,z)            Share of commodity i in total current public expenditures on goods and services
 610   gamma_INV(i,z)            Share of commodity i in total investment expenditures
 611   gamma_LES(i,z)             Marginal share of commodity i in household consumption budget
 612   exogro(z,time)               Exogenous growth factor for exogenously growing variables except labor
 613   growthz(z)                    Steady state grwoth
 614   AEEI(z,time)                  Autonomous energy efficiency improvement (Reference)
 615   AEEI_low(z,time)            Autonomous energy efficiency improvement (Low)
 616   AEEI_high(z,time)           Autonomous energy efficiency improvement (High)
 617   PERMIT_NDC(z,time)      PERMIT
 618   PERMIT_NZS(z,time)      PERMIT
 619   switch(i3,z,time)            binary variable - equals zero if no use of backstop technologies
 620   penetration_rate(i3,z,time)  penetration_rate
 621   recycle_gov(z,time)          binary variable - equals zero if no use of CTAX Rebate
 622   recycle_hou(z,time)          binary variable - equals zero if no use of CTAX Rebate
 623   recycle_labor(z,time)        binary variable - equals zero if no use of CTAX Rebate
 624   recycle_capital(z,time)      binary variable - equals zero if no use of CTAX Rebate
 625   recycle_ptax(z,time)         binary variable - equals zero if no use of CTAX Rebate
