--- LOAD  DSO_I = 19:DSO_I
--- LOAD  EXO = 20:EXO
--- LOAD  IMO = 21:IMO
--- LOAD  INVO = 22:INVO
--- LOAD  KSTO = 23:KSTO
--- LOAD  LDO = 24:LDO
--- LOAD  MRGNO = 25:MRGNO
--- LOAD  XSO = 37:XSO
--- LOAD  XSO_I = 38:XSO_I
--- LOAD  XSTO = 39:XSTO
--- LOAD  TOT_POP = 54:TOT_POP
--- LOAD  g_GDP = 55:g_GDP
