3897   EQ52_1(j,z,time)        KLE price
3898   EQ53(j,z,time)          Price of composite labor in industry j (redundant)
3899  * EQ53_1(j,z,time)        TIW Share
3900  * EQ53_1(k,j,z,time)     TIK Share
3901  * EQ54(l,j,z,time)       Wages including taxes
3902   EQ54(j,z,time)          Wages including taxes
3903   EQ54_1(ene,j,z,time)    energy commodity prices
3904  * EQ55(j,z)              Price of composite capital in industry j (redundant)
3905   EQ56(k,j,z,time)        Rental rate including taxes
3906  * EQ57(k,j,z,time)       Rate of remuneration of capital k (capital mobile)
3907   EQ58(i,z,time)          Producer price is a weighted sum of PE and PL
3908  * EQ59(i,z)              Price of composite export i (redundant)
3909   EQ60(i,z,zj,time)       Border price of exported commodity i
3910   EQ61(i,z,time)          Price of local product i (including all taxes and margins)
3911   EQ62(i,zj,z,time)       Price of imported commodity i (including all taxes and duties)
3912  * EQ63(i,z)              Price of composite import i (redundant)
3913   EQ64(i,z,time)          Consumer price is a weighted sum of PD and PM
3914  * EQ65(z,time)           Aggregate price of capital
3915   EQ66(z,time)            GDP deflator (Fischer index)
3916   EQ67(time)              World GDP deflator (Fischer index)
3917   EQ68(z,time)            Consumer price index (Laspeyres)
3918   EQ69(z,time)            Investment price index (derived from investment function)
3919   EQ70(z,time)            Public expenditure price index
3920   EQ71(i1,z,time)         Domestic absorbtion
3921   EQ71_2(i3,z,time)       Domestic absorbtion
3922  * EQ72(l,z,time)         Labor supply equals labor demand
3923   EQ72(z,time)            Labor supply equals labor demand
3924   EQ73(k,z,time)          Capital supply equals capital demand
3925   EQ74(z,time)            Total investment equals total savings
3926   EQ75(z,time)            Depreciation
3927   EQ76(i,z,time)          Supply of domestic production equals demand
3928   EQ77(i,z,zj,time)       Exports supply equals imports demand
3929   EQ78(i,z,zj,time)       Exports price equals imports price
3930   EQ79(i,time)            World demand for margins equals world supply
3931  * EQ80                   Sum of foreign savings equals zero (redundant)
3932   EQ81(z,time)            GDP at basic prices
3933   EQ82(z,time)            GDP at market prices
3934   EQ83(z,time)            GDP at market prices (income-based)
3935   EQ84(z,time)            GDP at market prices (expenditure-based)
3936   EQ85(time)              World GDP
3937   EQ86(z,time)            Real consumption budget of type h households
3938   EQ87(z,time)            Real current government expenditures on goods and services
3939   EQ88(z,time)            Real GDP at basic prices
3940   EQ89(time)              Real world GDP at basic prices
3941   EQ90(z,time)            Real GDP at market prices
3942   EQ91(z,time)            Real gross fixed capital formation
3943   EQ92(z,time)            Current account balance of region z in terms of the reference currency
3944  * EQ93                    fictitious OBJ. fuction
3945   WALRAS(z,time)          Walras law verification
3946  * EQB_1(i,z)             Top Nest - CES function Aggregated acitivty
3947  * EQB_2(j,i,z)           Top Nest - CES function Aggregated acitivty
3948  * EQB_3(j,i,z)           Total producer price is equal to P if there is only one product
3949  * EQB_4(j,i,z)           Basic price of industry j's production of commodity i
3950  * EQB_5(j,i,z)           Supply of exports for compsite activity
3951   EQA_1(z,time)           Top Nest - Leontief function Aggregated-Electricity
3952   EQA_2(Z,time)           Top Nest - Leontief function Aggregated-Electricity
3953   EQA_3(z,time)           Second Nest - CES function - Aggregated-Electricity
3954   EQA_4(power,i,z,time)   Second Nest - CES function - Aggregated-Electricity
3955   EQB_1(i2,z,time)        Industry j production of commodity i (CES)
3956   EQB_3(j,i,z,time)       Total producer price is equal to P if there is only one product
3957   EQB_4(j,i,z,time)       Basic price of industry js production of commodity i
3958   EQB_5(j,i,z,time)       Supply of exports for compsite activity
3959   EQ94(z,time)            Total investment expenditure constraint
3960   EQ95(z,time)            Aggregate price of capital
3961   EQ96(k,bus,z,time)      Investment demand by industry
3962   CALEQ3(k,pub,z,time)    Public investment demand
3963   EQ97a(z,time)           Interest rate (weighted average rate of return on capital)
3964   EQ97b(z,time)           User cost of capital
3965   EQ98(i3,z,time)
3966   EQ99(i3,z,time)
3967   EQ100(j,z,time)
3968   EQ101(j,z,time)
3969   EQ102(k,j,z,time)
3970   EQ103(i3,z,time)
3971   EQ104(i3,z,time)
3972   EQ105(i3,z,time)
3973   EQ106(z,time)           labor supply
3974   EQ107(j,z,time)
3975   EQ108(z,time)
3976   EQ109(z,time)
3977   EQ110(j,z,time)
3978   EQ111(j,z,time)
3979   EQ112(j,z,time)
3980   EQ113(j,z,time)
3981   EQ114(j,z,time)
3982   EQ115(j,z,time)
3983   EQ116(j,z,time)
3984   EQ117(j,z,time)
3985  ;
3986   
3987  *==============================================================================
3988  *  5.3 Equations
3989  *==============================================================================
3990  *   5.3.1 Production
3991  *==============================================================================
3992   EQ1(j3,z,t)..     VA(j3,z,t) =e= v(j3,z)*XST(j3,z,t);
3993   
3994   EQ1_1(j2,z,t)..   KLE(j2,z,t) =e= v2(j2,z)*XST(j2,z,t);
3995   
3996   EQ2(j,z,t)..      CI(j,z,t) =e= io(j,z)*XST(j,z,t);
3997   
3998   EQ2_1(j3,z,t)..   CE(j3,z,t) =e= io2(j3,z)*XST(j3,z,t);
3999   
4000   EQ3(j,z,t)..      VA(j,z,t) =e= A_VA(z,t)*B_VA_t(j,z,t)*{
4001                      [beta_VA(j,z)*LDC(j,z,t)**(-rho_VA(j,z))]$LDCO(j,z)
4002                     +[(1-beta_VA(j,z))*KDC(j,z,t)**(-rho_VA(j,z))]$KDCO(j,z)
4003                                                     }**(-1/rho_VA(j,z));
4004   
4005   EQ3_1(j2,z,t)..   KLE(j2,z,t) =e= B_KLE(j2,z)*{
4006                      [beta_KLE(j2,z)*VA(j2,z,t)**(-rho_KLE(j2,z))]$VAO(j2,z)
4007                     +[(1-beta_KLE(j2,z))*CE(j2,z,t)**(-rho_KLE(j2,z))]$CEO(j2,z)
4008                                                     }**(-1/rho_KLE(j2,z));
4009   
4010   EQ4_1(j2,z,t)$[VAO(j2,z) and CEO(j2,z)]..
4011                   VA(j2,z,t) =e= {[(1-beta_KLE2(j2,z))/(beta_KLE2(j2,z))]
4012                                *[PCE(j2,z,t)/PVA(j2,z,t)]}**sigma_KLE(j2,z)*CE(j2,z,t);
4013   
4014   EQ4(j,z,t)$[LDCO(j,z) and KDCO(j,z)]..
4015                   LDC(j,z,t) =e= {[beta_VA(j,z)/(1-beta_VA(j,z))]
4016                                *[RC(j,z,t)/WC(j,z,t)]}**sigma_VA(j,z)*KDC(j,z,t);
4017   
4018  * EQ5(j,z,t)$LDCO(j,z)..
4019  *                 LDC(j,z,t) =e= B_LD(j,z)*SUM[l$LDO(l,j,z),beta_LD(l,j,z)
4020  *                                *LD(l,j,z,t)**(-rho_LD(j,z))]**(-1/rho_LD(j,z));
4021   
4022   EQ5(j,z,t)$LDCO(j,z)..
4023                   LDC(j,z,t) =e= LD(j,z,t);
4024   
4025  * EQ6(l,j,z,t)$LDO(l,j,z)..
4026  *                 LD(l,j,z,t) =e= [beta_LD(l,j,z)*WC(j,z,t)/WTI(l,j,z,t)]
4027  *                               **sigma_LD(j,z)*B_LD(j,z)**(sigma_LD(j,z)-1)
4028  *                               *LDC(j,z,t);
4029   
4030   EQ7(j,z,t)$KDCO(j,z)..
4031                   KDC(j,z,t) =e= B_KD(j,z)*SUM[k$KDO(k,j,z),beta_KD(k,j,z)
4032                                  *KD(k,j,z,t)**(-rho_KD(j,z))]**(-1/rho_KD(j,z));
4033   
4034   EQ8(k,j,z,t)$KDO(k,j,z)..
4035                   KD(k,j,z,t) =e= [beta_KD(k,j,z)*RC(j,z,t)/RTI(k,j,z,t)]
4036                                   **sigma_KD(j,z)*B_KD(j,z)**(sigma_KD(j,z)-1)
4037                                   *KDC(j,z,t);
4038   
4039   EQ9(nene,j,z,t)..   DI(nene,j,z,t) =e= aij(nene,j,z)*CI(j,z,t) ;
4040   
4041   EQ9_1(ene,j3,z,t)..  DE(ene,j3,z,t)   =e= aij2(ene,j3,z)*CE(j3,z,t) ;
4042   
4043  *=============================Simple Nesting=========================================
4044  * EQ9_2(ene,j2,z,t)..  DE(ene,j2,z,t) =e= [beta_ENER_t(ene,j2,z,t)*PCE(j2,z,t)/((P4(ene,j2,z,t)+P4(ene,j2,z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2(ene,j2,z,t)))]
4045  *                                   **sigma_ENER(j2,z)*B_ENER_t(j2,z,t)**(sigma_ENER(j2,z)-1)
4046  *                                   *CE(j2,z,t);
4047   
4048  *=============================Leontief===========================================
4049  * EQ9_2(j2,z,t)..       DEelec(j2,z,t)  =e= Share_Elec(j2,z)*CE(j2,z,t);
4050   
4051  * EQ9_3(j2,z,t)..       DEnelec(j2,z,t) =e= (1-Share_Elec(j2,z))*CE(j2,z,t);
4052   
4053  * EQ9_4(ene3,j2,z,t)..  DE(ene3,j2,z,t) =e= Share_nElec(ene3,j2,z)*DEnelec(j2,z,t);
4054   
4055  * EQ9_5(ene2,j2,z,t)..  DE(ene2,j2,z,t) =e= DEelec(j2,z,t) ;
4056   
4057  *=============================Level 1, 2=======================================
4058  * EQ9_2(j2,z,t)..       CE(j2,z,t)  =e= B_ENER2(j2,z)*{[(beta_ENER2(j2,z))*DEelec(j2,z,t)**(-rho_ENER2(j2,z))]
4059  *                                                     +[(1-beta_ENER2(j2,z))*DEnelec(j2,z,t)**(-rho_ENER2(j2,z))]
4060  *                                                   }**(-1/rho_ENER2(j2,z));
4061   
4062  * EQ9_3(j2,z,t)..       DEelec(j2,z,t) =e= {[(beta_ENER2(j2,z))/(1-beta_ENER2(j2,z))]
4063  *                                        *[PCEnelec(j2,z,t)/PCEelec(j2,z,t)]}**sigma_ENER2(j2,z)*DEnelec(j2,z,t);
4064   
4065  * EQ9_4(ene3,j2,z,t)..  DE(ene3,j2,z,t) =e= [beta_ENER3(ene3,j2,z)*PCEnelec(j2,z,t)/P4(ene3,j2,z,t)]
4066  *                                            **sigma_ENER3(j2,z)*B_ENER3(j2,z)**(sigma_ENER3(j2,z)-1)
4067  *                                            *DEnelec(j2,z,t);
4068   
4069  * EQ9_5(ene2,j2,z,t)..  DE(ene2,j2,z,t) =e= DEelec(j2,z,t) ;
4070   
4071  *=============================Level 1, 2, 3 (Leonteif) =======================================
4072  * EQ9_2(j2,z,t)..        DEelec(j2,z,t)  =e= Share_Elec(j2,z)*CE(j2,z,t);
4073   
4074  * EQ9_3(j2,z,t)..        DEnelec(j2,z,t) =e= (1-Share_Elec(j2,z))*CE(j2,z,t);
4075   
4076  * EQ9_4(j2,z,t)..        DEcoalgas(j2,z,t) =e= Share_coalgas2(j2,z)*DEnelec(j2,z,t);
4077   
4078  * EQ9_5(j2,z,t)..        DEoilpetrol(j2,z,t) =e= (1-Share_coalgas2(j2,z))*DEnelec(j2,z,t);
4079   
4080  * EQ9_6(ene2,j2,z,t)..   DE(ene2,j2,z,t) =e= DEelec(j2,z,t) ;
4081   
4082  * EQ9_7(ene5,j2,z,t)..   DE(ene5,j2,z,t) =e= Share_coalgas(ene5,j2,z)*DEcoalgas(j2,z,t);
4083   
4084  * EQ9_8(ene6,j2,z,t)..   DE(ene6,j2,z,t) =e= Share_oilpetrol(ene6,j2,z)*DEoilpetrol(j2,z,t);
4085   
4086  *=============================Level 1, 2, 3 (CES) =======================================
4087   EQ9_2(j2,z,t)..        CE(j2,z,t)  =e= B_ENER2(j2,z)*{[(beta_ENER2(j2,z))*DEelec(j2,z,t)**(-rho_ENER2(j2,z))]
4088                                             +[(1-beta_ENER2(j2,z))*DEnelec(j2,z,t)**(-rho_ENER2(j2,z))]
4089                                              }**(-1/rho_ENER2(j2,z));
4090   
4091   EQ9_3(j2,z,t)..        DEnelec(j2,z,t) =e= {[(1-beta_ENER2(j2,z))/(beta_ENER2(j2,z))]
4092                                          *[PCEelec(j2,z,t)/PCEnelec(j2,z,t)]}**sigma_ENER2(j2,z)*DEelec(j2,z,t);
4093   
4094   EQ9_4(j2,z,t)..        DEnelec(j2,z,t) =e= B_ENER4(j2,z)*{[(beta_ENER4(j2,z))*DEcoalgas(j2,z,t)**(-rho_ENER4(j2,z))]
4095                                             +[(1-beta_ENER4(j2,z))*DEoilpetrol(j2,z,t)**(-rho_ENER4(j2,z))]
4096                                              }**(-1/rho_ENER4(j2,z));
4097   
4098   EQ9_5(j2,z,t)..        DEoilpetrol(j2,z,t) =e= {[(1-beta_ENER4(j2,z))/(beta_ENER4(j2,z))]
4099                                         *[PCEcoalgas(j2,z,t)/PCEoilpetrol(j2,z,t)]}**sigma_ENER4(j2,z)*DEcoalgas(j2,z,t);
4100   
4101   EQ9_6(ene2,j2,z,t)..   DE(ene2,j2,z,t) =e= DEelec(j2,z,t) ;
4102   
4103   EQ9_7(ene5,j2,z,t)..   DE(ene5,j2,z,t) =e= [beta_ENER5_1(ene5,j2,z)*PCEcoalgas(j2,z,t)/(P4(ene5,j2,z,t)+P4(ene5,j2,z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2(ene5,j2,z,t))]
4104                                              **sigma_ENER5_1(j2,z)*B_ENER5_1(j2,z)**(sigma_ENER5_1(j2,z)-1)
4105                                              *DEcoalgas(j2,z,t);
4106   
4107   EQ9_8(ene6,j2,z,t)..   DE(ene6,j2,z,t) =e= [beta_ENER5_2(ene6,j2,z)*PCEoilpetrol(j2,z,t)/(P4(ene6,j2,z,t)+P4(ene6,j2,z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2(ene6,j2,z,t))]
4108                                              **sigma_ENER5_2(j2,z)*B_ENER5_2(j2,z)**(sigma_ENER5_2(j2,z)-1)
4109                                              *DEoilpetrol(j2,z,t);
4110   
4111  *==============================================================================
4112  *   5.3.2 Income and savings
4113  *==============================================================================
4114  *    5.3.2.1 Households
4115  *==============================================================================
4116   EQ10(z,t)..       YH(z,t) =e= YHL(z,t)+YHK(z,t)+SUM(i3,MARKUP(i3,z,t))+REBATE(z,t)*recycle_hou(z,t) ;
4117   
4118   EQ11(z,t)..       YHL(z,t) =e= SUM[(j)$LDO(j,z),W(z,t)*LD(j,z,t)];
4119   
4120   EQ12(z,t)..       YHK(z,t) =e= SUM[(k,j)$KDO(k,j,z),R(k,j,z,t)*KD(k,j,z,t)];
4121   
4122   EQ13(z,t)..       YDH(z,t) =e= YH(z,t)-TDH(z,t);
4123   
4124   EQ14(z,t)..       CTH(z,t) =e= YDH(z,t)-SH(z,t);
4125   
4126   EQ15(z,t)..       SH(z,t) =e= PIXCON(z,t)**eta*sh0(z,t)+sh1(z,t)*YDH(z,t);
4127   
4128   CALEQ1(z,t)..     SH(z,t)+SG(z,t) =e= sh1(z,t)*GDP_IB(z,t);
4129   
4130  *==============================================================================
4131  *    5.3.2.2 Government
4132  *==============================================================================
4133   EQ16(z,t)..       YG(z,t) =e= TDH(z,t)+TPRODN(z,t)+TPRCTS(z,t)+REBATE(z,t)*recycle_gov(z,t);
4134   
4135   EQ16_1(z,t)..    TCTAX(z,t) =e= sum((ene,j), PC(ene,z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2(ene,j,z,t)*DE(ene,j,z,t));
4136   
4137   EQ17(z,t)..       TPRODN(z,t) =e= TIWT(z,t)+TIKT(z,t)+TIPT(z,t);
4138   
4139   EQ18(z,t)..       TIWT(z,t) =e= SUM[(j)$LDO(j,z),TIW(j,z,t)];
4140   
4141   EQ19(z,t)..       TIKT(z,t) =e= SUM[(k,j)$KDO(k,j,z),TIK(k,j,z,t)];
4142   
4143   EQ20(z,t)..       TIPT(z,t) =e= SUM[j,TIP(j,z,t)];
4144   
4145   EQ21(z,t)..       TPRCTS(z,t) =e= TICT(z,t)+TIMT(z,t)+TIXT(z,t);
4146   
4147   EQ22(z,t)..       TICT(z,t) =e= SUM[i,TIC(i,z,t)];
4148   
4149   EQ23(z,t)..       TIMT(z,t) =e= SUM[(i,zj)$IMO(i,zj,z),TIM(i,zj,z,t)];
4150   
4151   EQ24(z,t)..       TIXT(z,t) =e= SUM[(i,zj)$EXO(i,z,zj),TIX(i,z,zj,t)];
4152   
4153   EQ25(z,t)..       TDH(z,t) =e= PIXCON(z,t)**eta*ttdh0(z,t)+ttdh1(z,t)*YH(z,t);
4154   
4155   EQ26(j,z,t)$LDO(j,z)..
4156                   TIW(j,z,t) =e= ttiw(j,z,t)*W(z,t)*LD(j,z,t) -LaborRebate(j,z,t);
4157   
4158   EQ27(k,j,z,t)$KDO(k,j,z)..
4159                   TIK(k,j,z,t) =e= ttik(k,j,z,t)*R(k,j,z,t)*KD(k,j,z,t);
4160   
4161   EQ28(j,z,t)..     TIP(j,z,t) =e= ttip(j,z,t)*PP(j,z,t)*XST(j,z,t);
4162   
4163   EQ29(i,z,t)..     TIC(i,z,t) =e= ttic(i,z,t)*{[PL(i,z,t)*DD(i,z,t)]$DDO(i,z)
4164                   +[SUM[zj$IMO(i,zj,z),(1+ttim(i,zj,z,t))*IM(i,zj,z,t)*e(z,t)
4165                    *(PWM(i,zj,z,t)+SUM(ij,PWMG(ij,t)*tmrg(ij,i,zj,z)))]]};
4166   
4167   EQ30(i,zj,z,t)$IMO(i,zj,z)..
4168                   TIM(i,zj,z,t) =e= ttim(i,zj,z,t)*IM(i,zj,z,t)*e(z,t)*
4169                                     (PWM(i,zj,z,t)+SUM[ij,PWMG(ij,t)
4170                                     *tmrg(ij,i,zj,z)]);
4171   
4172   EQ31(i,z,zj,t)$EXO(i,z,zj)..
4173                   TIX(i,z,zj,t) =e= ttix(i,z,zj,t)*PE(i,z,zj,t)*EX(i,z,zj,t);
4174   
4175   EQ32(z,t)..       SG(z,t) =e= YG(z,t)-G(z,t);
4176   
4177  *==============================================================================
4178  *    5.3.2.4 Rest of the world
4179  *==============================================================================
4180   EQ33(z,t)..       YROW(z,t) =e= e(z,t)*SUM{(i,zj)$IMO(i,zj,z),IM(i,zj,z,t)*
4181                             [PWM(i,zj,z,t)+SUM(ij,PWMG(ij,t)*tmrg(ij,i,zj,z))]};
4182   
4183   EQ34(z,t)..       SROW(z,t) =e= YROW(z,t)-e(z,t)*SUM[(i,zj)$EXO(i,z,zj),
4184                                 EX(i,z,zj,t)*PWX(i,z,zj,t)]-e(z,t)
4185                                 *SUM[i$MRGNO(i,z),MRGN(i,z,t)*PWMG(i,t)];
4186   
4187   EQ35(z,t)..       SROW(z,t) =e= -CAB(z,t);
4188   
4189  *==============================================================================
4190  *   5.3.3 Demand
4191  *==============================================================================
4192   EQ36(i,z,t)..     PC(i,z,t)*C(i,z,t) =e= PC(i,z,t)*CMIN(i,z,t)+gamma_LES(i,z)
4193                                   *{CTH(z,t)-SUM[ij,PC(ij,z,t)*CMIN(ij,z,t)]};
4194   
4195   EQ37(i,z,t)..     PC(i,z,t)*INV(i,z,t) =e= gamma_INV(i,z)*IT(z,t);
4196   
4197   EQ38(i,z,t)..     PC(i,z,t)*CG(i,z,t) =e= gamma_GVT(i,z)*G(z,t);
4198   
4199   CALEQ2(z,t)..     G(z,t) =e= GO(z)*GDP_BP(z,t)/GDP_BPO(z);
4200   
4201   EQ39(nene,z,t)..    DIT(nene,z,t) =e= SUM[j,DI(nene,j,z,t)];
4202   
4203   EQ39_1(ene1,z,t)..  DIT(ene1,z,t) =e= SUM[j,DE(ene1,j,z,t)];
4204   
4205   EQ39_2(ene2,z,t)..  DIT(ene2,z,t) =e= SUM[j,DE(ene2,j,z,t)];
4206   
4207  *==============================================================================
4208  *   5.3.4 International trade
4209  *==============================================================================
       EQB_1(i,z)..    XS_I(i,z) =e= B_X3(i,z)*SUM[j$XSO(j,i,z),beta_X3(j,i,z)
                                      *XS(j,i,z)**(-rho_X3(i,z))]**(-1/rho_X3(i,z));
       
       EQB_2(j,i,z)${DSO(j,i,z) and [DSO(j,i,z) ne DSO_I(i,z)]}..
                       XS(j,i,z) =e= XS_I(i,z)/B_X3(i,z)**(1-sigma_X3(i,z))*
                                     [beta_X3(j,i,z)*PI(i,z)/P2(j,i,z)]
                                     **sigma_X3(i,z);
       
       EQB_3(j,i,z)${DSO(j,i,z)}..   P2(j,i,z) =e= PT(j,z);
       
       EQB_4(j,i,z)$DSO(j,i,z)..
                       P2(j,i,z)*XS(j,i,z) =e= [PET(i,z)*EXTT(j,i,z)]$EXTTO(j,i,z)
                                              +[e(z)*MRGN(i,z)*PWMG(i)]$MRGNO(i,z)
                                              +[PL(i,z)*DS(j,i,z)]$DSO(j,i,z);
       
       EQB_5(j,i,z)$DSO(j,i,z)..  EXTT(j,i,z)  =e= theta2(j,i,z)*EXT(i,z);
4228   
4229  *[Top Nest - Leontief function]
4230   EQA_1(z,t)..  XS('18_TnD','18_ELEC',z,t) =e= TnDShare(z)*XS_I('18_ELEC',z,t);
4231   EQA_2(z,t)..  XS_I('18_ELEC',z,t) =e= XS('18_TnD','18_ELEC',z,t) + POWERQ(z,t);
4232   
4233   
4234  *[Second Nest - CES function]
4235  * EQA_3(z,t)..    POWERQ(z,t) =e= B_X4(z)*SUM[POWER, beta_X4(power,z)
4236  *                                *XS(POWER,'18_ELEC',z,t)**(-rho_X4(z))]**(-1/rho_X4(z));
4237   EQA_3(z,t)..    POWERQ(z,t) =e= B_X4(z)*SUM[POWER, beta_X4(power,z)
4238                                  *XS(POWER,'18_ELEC',z,t)**(-rho_X4(z))]**(-1/rho_X4(z));
4239   
4240  * EQA_4(power,'18_ELEC',z,t)..  XS(POWER,'18_ELEC',z,t) =e= POWERQ(z,t)/B_X4(z)**(1-sigma_X4(z))*
4241  *                               [beta_X4(power,z)*PPOWER(z,t)/P2(POWER,'18_ELEC',z,t)]
4242  *                               **sigma_X4(z);
4243   
4244   EQA_4(power,'18_ELEC',z,t)..  XS(POWER,'18_ELEC',z,t) =e= POWERQ(z,t)/B_X4(z)**(1-sigma_X4(z))*
4245                                 [beta_X4(power,z)*PPOWER(z,t)/P2(POWER,'18_ELEC',z,t)]
4246                                 **sigma_X4(z);
4247   
4248  * exclude electiricity
4249   EQB_1(i2,z,t)..    XS_I(i2,z,t) =e= B_X3(i2,z)*SUM[j$XSO(j,i2,z),beta_X3(j,i2,z)
4250                                  *XS(j,i2,z,t)**(-rho_X3(i2,z))]**(-1/rho_X3(i2,z));
4251   
4252   
4253   EQB_3(j,i,z,t)${DSO(j,i,z)}..   P2(j,i,z,t) =e= PT(j,z,t);
4254   
4255   EQB_4(j,i,z,t)$DSO(j,i,z)..
4256                   P2(j,i,z,t)*XS(j,i,z,t) =e= [PET(i,z,t)*EXTT(j,i,z,t)]$EXTTO(j,i,z)
4257                                          +[e(z,t)*MRGN(i,z,t)*PWMG(i,t)]$MRGNO(i,z)
4258                                          +[PL(i,z,t)*DS(j,i,z,t)]$DSO(j,i,z);
4259   
4260   EQB_5(j,i,z,t)$DSO(j,i,z)..  EXTT(j,i,z,t)  =e= theta2(j,i,z)*EXT(i,z,t);
4261   
4262   EQ40_3(i,z,t)..   DS_I(i,z,t) =e= sum(j,DS(j,i,z,t)$DSO(j,i,z));
4263   
4264   EQ40_4(j,z,t)..   XST(j,z,t)  =e= sum(i,XS(j,i,z,t)$XSO(j,i,z));
4265   
4266   EQ40_5(i,z,t)..   XS_I(i,z,t) =e= B_X1(i,z)*{
4267                   [beta_EX_X1(i,z)*EXT(i,z,t)**rho_X1(i,z)]$EXTO(i,z)
4268                  +[beta_D_X1(i,z)*DS_I(i,z,t)**rho_X1(i,z)]$DSO_I(i,z)
4269                  +[(1-beta_EX_X1(i,z)-beta_D_X1(i,z))*MRGN(i,z,t)**rho_X1(i,z)]$MRGNO(i,z)
4270                                            }**(1/rho_X1(i,z));
4271   
4272   EQ41(i,z,t)$[EXTO(i,z) and DSO_I(i,z)]..
4273                   EXT(i,z,t) =e= {[beta_D_X1(i,z)/beta_EX_X1(i,z)]*[PET(i,z,t)/PL(i,z,t)]}
4274                                **sigma_X1(i,z)*DS_I(i,z,t);
4275   
4276   EQ42(i,z,t)$[MRGNO(i,z) and DSO_I(i,z)]..
4277                   MRGN(i,z,t) =e= {[beta_D_X1(i,z)/(1-beta_EX_X1(i,z)
4278                                   -beta_D_X1(i,z))]*[e(z,t)*PWMG(i,t)/PL(i,z,t)]}
4279                                   **sigma_X1(i,z)*DS_I(i,z,t);
4280   
4281   EQ43(i,z,t)$EXTO(i,z)..
4282                   EXT(i,z,t) =e= B_X2(i,z)*SUM[zj$EXO(i,z,zj),beta_X2(i,z,zj)
4283                                  *EX(i,z,zj,t)**rho_X2(i,z)]**(1/rho_X2(i,z));
4284   
4285   EQ44(i,z,zj,t)$EXO(i,z,zj)..
4286                   EX(i,z,zj,t) =e= EXT(i,z,t)/B_X2(i,z)**(1+sigma_X2(i,z))*
4287                                    [PE(i,z,zj,t)/(beta_X2(i,z,zj)*PET(i,z,t))]
4288                                    **sigma_X2(i,z);
4289   
4290   EQ45(i,z,t)..     Q(i,z,t) =e= B_M1(i,z)*{
4291                      [beta_M1(i,z)*IMT(i,z,t)**(-rho_M1(i,z))]$IMTO(i,z)
4292                     +[(1-beta_M1(i,z))*DD(i,z,t)**(-rho_M1(i,z))]$DDO(i,z)
4293                                          }**(-1/rho_M1(i,z));
4294   
4295   EQ46(i,z,t)$[IMTO(i,z) and DDO(i,z)]..
4296                   IMT(i,z,t) =e= {[beta_M1(i,z)/(1-beta_M1(i,z))]*[PD(i,z,t)
4297                                  /PMT(i,z,t)]}**sigma_m1(i,z)*DD(i,z,t);
4298   
4299   EQ47(i,z,t)$IMTO(i,z)..
4300                   IMT(i,z,t) =e= B_M2(i,z)*SUM[zj$IMO(i,zj,z),beta_M2(i,zj,z)*
4301                                  IM(i,zj,z,t)**(-rho_M2(i,z))]**(-1/rho_M2(i,z));
4302   
4303   EQ48(i,zj,z,t)$IMO(i,zj,z)..
4304                   IM(i,zj,z,t) =e= IMT(i,z,t)/B_M2(i,z)**(1-sigma_M2(i,z))*
4305                                    [beta_M2(i,zj,z)*PMT(i,z,t)/PM(i,zj,z,t)]
4306                                    **sigma_M2(i,z);
4307   
4308  *==============================================================================
4309  *   5.3.5 Prices
4310  *==============================================================================
4311   EQ49(j2,z,t)..      PP(j2,z,t)*XST(j2,z,t) =e= PKLE(j2,z,t)*KLE(j2,z,t)+PCI(j2,z,t)*CI(j2,z,t);
4312   
4313   EQ49_1(j3,z,t)..    PP(j3,z,t)*XST(j3,z,t) =e= PVA(j3,z,t)*VA(j3,z,t)+PCI(j3,z,t)*CI(j3,z,t)+PCE(j3,z,t)*CE(j3,z,t);
4314   
4315   EQ50(j,z,t)..        PT(j,z,t) =e= (1+ttip(j,z,t))*PP(j,z,t);
4316   
4317   EQ51(j,z,t)..        PCI(j,z,t)*CI(j,z,t) =e= SUM[nene,PC(nene,z,t)*DI(nene,j,z,t)];
4318   
4319  *Simple Nesting
4320  * EQ51_1(j,z,t)..    PCE(j,z,t)*CE(j,z,t) =e= SUM[ene,PC(ene,z,t)*DE(ene,j,z,t) + PC(ene,z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2(ene,j,z,t)*DE(ene,j,z,t)];
4321   
4322  *============================== Level 1-3 ========================================
4323  * EQ51_1(j2,z,t)..   PCE(j2,z,t)*CE(j2,z,t) =e= [PCEelec(j2,z,t)*DEelec(j2,z,t)+PCEnelec(j2,z,t)*DEnelec(j2,z,t)];
4324   
4325  * EQ51_12(j3,z,t)..  PCE(j3,z,t)*CE(j3,z,t) =e= SUM[ene,PC(ene,z,t)*DE(ene,j3,z,t)+PC(ene,z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2(ene,j3,z,t)*DE(ene,j3,z,t)];
4326   
4327  * EQ51_2(j2,z,t)..   PCEelec(j2,z,t)*DEelec(j2,z,t) =e= PC("18_ELEC",z,t)*DE("18_ELEC",j2,z,t);
4328   
4329  * EQ51_3(j2,z,t)..   PCEnelec(j2,z,t)*DEnelec(j2,z,t) =e= SUM[ene3,PC(ene3,z,t)*DE(ene3,j2,z,t)+PC(ene3,z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2(ene3,j2,z,t)*DE(ene3,j2,z,t)];
4330  *================================= Level 1-5 ======================================
4331   EQ51_2(j3,z,t)..   PCE(j3,z,t)*CE(j3,z,t) =e= SUM[ene,PC(ene,z,t)*DE(ene,j3,z,t)+PC(ene,z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2(ene,j3,z,t)*DE(ene,j3,z,t)];
4332   
4333   EQ51_1(j2,z,t)..   PCE(j2,z,t)*CE(j2,z,t) =e= [PCEelec(j2,z,t)*DEelec(j2,z,t)+PCEnelec(j2,z,t)*DEnelec(j2,z,t)];
4334   
4335   EQ51_3(j2,z,t)..   PCEelec(j2,z,t)*DEelec(j2,z,t) =e= PC("18_ELEC",z,t)*DE("18_ELEC",j2,z,t);
4336   
4337   EQ51_4(j2,z,t)..   PCEnelec(j2,z,t)*DEnelec(j2,z,t) =e= [PCEcoalgas(j2,z,t)*DEcoalgas(j2,z,t)+PCEoilpetrol(j2,z,t)*DEoilpetrol(j2,z,t)];
4338   
4339   EQ51_5(j2,z,t)..   PCEcoalgas(j2,z,t)*DEcoalgas(j2,z,t) =e= [PC("02_COAL",z,t)*DE("02_COAL",j2,z,t)+PC("02_COAL",z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2("02_COAL",j2,z,t)*DE("02_COAL",j2,z,t)
4340                      +PC("04_GAS",z,t)*DE("04_GAS",j2,z,t)+PC("04_GAS",z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2("04_GAS",j2,z,t)*DE("04_GAS",j2,z,t)];
4341   
4342   EQ51_6(j2,z,t)..   PCEoilpetrol(j2,z,t)*DEoilpetrol(j2,z,t) =e= [PC("03_OIL",z,t)*DE("03_OIL",j2,z,t)+PC("03_OIL",z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2("03_OIL",j2,z,t)*DE("03_OIL",j2,z,t)
4343                      +PC("10_PETROLCOAL",z,t)*DE("10_PETROLCOAL",j2,z,t)+PC("10_PETROLCOAL",z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2("10_PETROLCOAL",j2,z,t)*DE("10_PETROLCOAL",j2,z,t)];
4344  *==================================================================================
4345   
4346   EQ52(j,z,t)..      PVA(j,z,t)*VA(j,z,t) =e= [WC(j,z,t)*LDC(j,z,t)]$LDCO(j,z)
4347                                       +[RC(j,z,t)*KDC(j,z,t)]$KDCO(j,z);
4348   
4349   EQ52_1(j2,z,t)..   PKLE(j2,z,t)*KLE(j2,z,t) =e= [PVA(j2,z,t)*VA(j2,z,t)]$VAO(j2,z)
4350                                         +[PCE(j2,z,t)*CE(j2,z,t)]$CEO(j2,z);
4351   
4352  * Given equations 5 and 6, equation 53 is redundant
4353  * EQ53(j,z)..     WC(j,z)*LDC(j,z) =e= SUM[l$LDO(l,j,z),WTI(l,j,z)*LD(l,j,z)];
4354   EQ53(j,z,t)..     WC(j,z,t)*LDC(j,z,t) =e= WTI(j,z,t)*LD(j,z,t);
4355   
4356   EQ54(j,z,t)$LDO(j,z)..
4357                   WTI(j,z,t)*LD(j,z,t) =e= W(z,t)*(1+ttiw(j,z,t))*LD(j,z,t) -LaborRebate(j,z,t);
4358   
4359   EQ54_1(ene,j2,z,t)$DEO(ene,j2,z)..
4360                   P4(ene,j2,z,t) =e= PC(ene,z,t);
4361   
4362  * Given equations 7 and 8, equation 55 is redundant
4363  * EQ55(j,z)$(kmob and KDCO(j,z))..
4364  *                 RC(j,z)*KDC(j,z) =e= SUM[k$KDO(k,j,z),RTI(k,j,z)*KD(k,j,z)];
4365   
4366   EQ56(k,j,z,t)$KDO(k,j,z)..
4367                   RTI(k,j,z,t) =e= R(k,j,z,t)*(1+ttik(k,j,z,t));
4368   
4369  * EQ57(k,j,z,t)$(kmob and KDO(k,j,z))..
4370  *                 R(k,j,z,t) =e= RK(k,z,t);
4371   
4372   EQ58(i,z,t)..     P(i,z,t)*XS_I(i,z,t) =e= [PL(i,z,t)*DS_I(i,z,t)]$DSO_I(i,z)
4373                                       +[PET(i,z,t)*EXT(i,z,t)]$EXTO(i,z)
4374                                       +[e(z,t)*PWMG(i,t)*MRGN(i,z,t)]$MRGNO(i,z);
4375   
4376  * Given equations 43 and 44, equation 59 is redundant
4377  * EQ59(i,z)$EXTO(i,z)..
4378  *                 PET(i,z)*EXT(i,z) =e= SUM[zj$EXO(i,z,zj),
4379  *                                           PE(i,z,zj)*EX(i,z,zj);
4380   
4381   EQ60(i,z,zj,t)$EXO(i,z,zj)..
4382                   PE(i,z,zj,t)*(1+ttix(i,z,zj,t)) =e= e(z,t)*PWX(i,z,zj,t);
4383   
4384   EQ61(i,z,t)$DDO(i,z)..
4385                   PD(i,z,t) =e= (1+ttic(i,z,t))*PL(i,z,t);
4386   
4387   EQ62(i,zj,z,t)$IMO(i,zj,z)..
4388                   PM(i,zj,z,t) =e= (1+ttic(i,z,t))*(1+ttim(i,zj,z,t))*e(z,t)*
4389                                    (PWM(i,zj,z,t)+SUM[ij,PWMG(ij,t)
4390                                    *tmrg(ij,i,zj,z)]);
4391   
4392  * Given equations 47 and 48, equation 63 is redundant
4393  * EQ63(i,z)$IMTO(i,z)..
4394  *                 PMT(i,z)*IMT(i,z) =e= SUM[zj$IMO(i,zj,z),
4395  *                                           PM(i,zj,z)*IM(i,zj,z);
4396   
4397   EQ64(i,z,t)..     PC(i,z,t)*Q(i,z,t) =e= [PD(i,z,t)*DD(i,z,t)]$DDO(i,z)+
4398                                      [PMT(i,z,t)*IMT(i,z,t)]$IMTO(i,z);
4399   
4400  * EQ65(z,t)..       PK(z,t) =e= 1/A_K(z)*PROD[i$gamma_INV(i,z),(PC(i,z,t)
4401  *                               /gamma_INV(i,z))**gamma_INV(i,z)];
4402   
4403   EQ66(z,t)..       PIXGDP(z,t) =e=
4404                   {SUM[j,{(PVA(j,z,t)*VA(j,z,t)+TIP(j,z,t))/VA(j,z,t)}*VAO(j,z)]
4405                   /SUM[j,{(PVAO(j,z)*VAO(j,z)+TIPO(j,z))/VAO(j,z)}*VAO(j,z)]
4406                   *SUM[j,{(PVA(j,z,t)*VA(j,z,t)+TIP(j,z,t))/VA(j,z,t)}*VA(j,z,t)]
4407                   /SUM[j,{(PVAO(j,z)*VAO(j,z)+TIPO(j,z))/VAO(j,z)}*VA(j,z,t)]}**0.5;
4408   
4409   EQ67(t)..         PIXGDP_W(t) =e=
4410                   {SUM[(j,z),{(PVA(j,z,t)*VA(j,z,t)+TIP(j,z,t))/VA(j,z,t)}*VAO(j,z)/e(z,t)]
4411                   /SUM[(j,z),{(PVAO(j,z)*VAO(j,z)+TIPO(j,z))/VAO(j,z)}*VAO(j,z)/eO(z)]
4412                   *SUM[(j,z),{(PVA(j,z,t)*VA(j,z,t)+TIP(j,z,t))/VA(j,z,t)}*VA(j,z,t)/e(z,t)]
4413                   /SUM[(j,z),{(PVAO(j,z)*VAO(j,z)+TIPO(j,z))/VAO(j,z)}*VA(j,z,t)/eO(z)]}**0.5;
4414   
4415   EQ68(z,t)..       PIXCON(z,t) =e= SUM[i,PC(i,z,t)*CO(i,z)]/SUM[i,PCO(i,z)*CO(i,z)];
4416   
4417   EQ69(z,t)..       PIXINV(z,t) =e= PROD[i$gamma_INV(i,z),(PC(i,z,t)/PCO(i,z))
4418                                   **gamma_INV(i,z)];
4419   
4420   EQ70(z,t)..       PIXGVT(z,t) =e= PROD[i$gamma_GVT(i,z),(PC(i,z,t)/PCO(i,z))
4421                                   **gamma_GVT(i,z)];
4422   
4423  *==============================================================================
4424  *   5.3.6 Equilibrium
4425  *==============================================================================
4426   EQ71(i1,z,t)..    Q(i1,z,t) =e= C(i1,z,t)+CG(i1,z,t)+INV(i1,z,t)+DIT(i1,z,t);
4427   
4428   EQ71_2(i3,z,t)..  Q(i3,z,t) =e= C_Conventional(i3,z,t);
4429   
4430   EQ72(z,t)..     LS(z,t) =e= SUM[j$LDO(j,z),LD(j,z,t)];
4431   
4432   EQ73(k,z,t)$KSO(k,z)..
4433                     KS(k,z,t) =e= SUM[j$KDO(k,j,z),KD(k,j,z,t)];
4434   
4435   EQ74(z,t)..       IT(z,t) =e= SH(z,t)+SG(z,t)-CAB(z,t);
4436   
4437   EQ75(z,t)..       DEP(z,t) =e= PK(z,t)*delta(z)*SUM[k$KSO(k,z),KS(k,z,t)];
4438   
4439   EQ76(i,z,t)$DDO(i,z)..
4440                     SUM[j$DSO(j,i,z),DS(j,i,z,t)] =e= DD(i,z,t);
4441   
4442   EQ77(i,z,zj,t)$EXO(i,z,zj)..
4443                     EX(i,z,zj,t) =e= IM(i,z,zj,t);
4444   
4445   EQ78(i,z,zj,t)$EXO(i,z,zj)..
4446                     PWX(i,z,zj,t) =e= PWM(i,z,zj,t);
4447   
4448   EQ79(i,t)..       SUM[z$MRGNO(i,z),MRGN(i,z,t)] =e= SUM[(z,zj,ij)$IMO(ij,zj,z),
4449                                                   tmrg(i,ij,zj,z)*IM(ij,zj,z,t)];
4450   
4451  * Given equations 33, 34 and 77, equation 80 is redundant
4452  * EQ80..          SUM[z,SROW(z)/e(z)] =e= 0;
4453   
4454  *==============================================================================
4455  *   5.3.7 Gross domestic product
4456  *==============================================================================
4457   EQ81(z,t)..       GDP_BP(z,t) =e= SUM[j,PVA(j,z,t)*VA(j,z,t)]+TIPT(z,t);
4458   
4459   EQ82(z,t)..       GDP_MP(z,t) =e= GDP_BP(z,t)+TPRCTS(z,t);
4460   
4461   EQ83(z,t)..       GDP_IB(z,t) =e= SUM[(j)$LDO(j,z),W(z,t)*LD(j,z,t)]
4462                                +SUM[(k,j)$KDO(k,j,z),R(k,j,z,t)*KD(k,j,z,t)]
4463                                +TPRCTS(z,t)+TPRODN(z,t);
4464   
4465   EQ84(z,t)..       GDP_FD(z,t) =e=
4466                   SUM[i,PC(i,z,t)*(C(i,z,t)+CG(i,z,t)+INV(i,z,t))]
4467                  +SUM[(i,zj)$EXO(i,z,zj),e(z,t)*PWX(i,z,zj,t)*EX(i,z,zj,t)]
4468                  +SUM[i$MRGNO(i,z),e(z,t)*PWMG(i,t)*MRGN(i,z,t)]
4469                  -SUM[(i,zj)$IMO(i,zj,z),e(z,t)*IM(i,zj,z,t)
4470                      *(PWM(i,zj,z,t)+SUM[ij,PWMG(ij,t)*tmrg(ij,i,zj,z)])]
4471                  -TCTAX(z,t) ;
4472   
4473   EQ85(t)..          GDP_BP_W(t) =e= SUM[z,GDP_BP(z,t)/e(z,t)];
4474   
4475  *==============================================================================
4476  *  5.3.8 Real (volume) variables computed from price indices
4477  *==============================================================================
4478   EQ86(z,t)..       CTH_REAL(z,t) =e= CTH(z,t)/PIXCON(z,t);
4479   
4480   EQ87(z,t)..       G_REAL(z,t) =e= G(z,t)/PIXGVT(z,t);
4481   
4482   EQ88(z,t)..       GDP_BP_REAL(z,t) =e= GDP_BP(z,t)/PIXGDP(z,t);
4483   
4484   EQ89(t)..         GDP_BP_W_REAL(t) =e= GDP_BP_W(t)/PIXGDP_W(t);
4485   
4486   EQ90(z,t)..       GDP_MP_REAL(z,t) =e= GDP_MP(z,t)/PIXCON(z,t);
4487   
4488   EQ91(z,t)..       IT_REAL(z,t) =e= IT(z,t)/PIXINV(z,t);
4489   
4490   EQ92(z,t)..       CABX(z,t) =e= CAB(z,t)/[PIXGDP_W(t)*e(z,t)];
4491   
4492  *==============================================================================
4493  *   5.3.8 Dynamic equations
4494  *==============================================================================
4495   EQ94(z,t)..     IT(z,t) =e= PK(z,t)*SUM[(k,j)$KDO(k,j,z),IND(k,j,z,t)];
4496   
4497   EQ95(z,t)..     PK(z,t) =e= 1/A_K(z)*PROD[i$gamma_INV(i,z),(PC(i,z,t)
4498                                 /gamma_INV(i,z))**gamma_INV(i,z)];
4499   
4500   EQ96(k,bus,z,t)$KDO(k,bus,z)..
4501                   IND(k,bus,z,t) =e= phi(z,t)*[R(k,bus,z,t)/U(z,t)]
4502                                    **sigma_INV(k,bus,z)*KD(k,bus,z,t);
4503   
4504   CALEQ3(k,pub,z,t)$KDO(k,pub,z)..
4505                   IND(k,pub,z,t)*PK(z,t) =e= INDO(k,pub,z)*PKO(z)*GDP_BP(z,t)
4506                                              /GDP_BPO(z);
4507   
4508   EQ97a(z,t)..    IR(z,t) =e= {SUM[(k,j)$KDO(k,j,z),
4509                                R(k,j,z,t)*KD(k,j,z,t)]-DEP(z,t)}/
4510                               {PK(z,t)*SUM[(k,j)$KDO(k,j,z),KD(k,j,z,t)]};
4511   
4512   EQ97b(z,t)..    U(z,t) =e= PK(z,t)*(delta(z)+IR(z,t));
4513   
4514  *==============================================================================
4515  *   5.3.9 Other
4516  *==============================================================================
4517   WALRAS(z,t)..   LEON(z,t) =e= Q('01_AGRICULT',z,t)-C('01_AGRICULT',z,t)-CG('01_AGRICULT',z,t)-INV('01_AGRICULT',z,t)
4518                              -DIT('01_AGRICULT',z,t);
4519   
4520  *==============================================================================
4521  *   5.3.10 Backstop technology
4522  *==============================================================================
4523   EQ98(i3,z,t)..    C_Conventional(i3,z,t) =e= (1-penetration_rate(i3,z,t)*switch(i3,z,t))*[C(i3,z,t)+CG(i3,z,t)+INV(i3,z,t)+DIT(i3,z,t)];
4524   
4525   EQ99(i3,z,t)..    XDBS(i3,z,t) =e= penetration_rate(i3,z,t)*switch(i3,z,t)*[C(i3,z,t)+CG(i3,z,t)+INV(i3,z,t)+DIT(i3,z,t)];
4526   
4527   EQ100(j,z,t)..    XDBS2(j,z,t) =e= sum{i3$COMtoIND(j,i3),XDBS(i3,z,t)};
4528   
4529   EQ101(j,z,t)..    LBS(j,z,t) =e= 0.1*XDBS2(j,z,t);
4530   
4531   EQ102(k,j,z,t)..  KBS(k,j,z,t) =e= 0.1*XDBS2(j,z,t)*KDO(k,j,z)/sum(kj,KDO(kj,j,z));
4532   
4533   EQ103(i3,z,t)..   CLBS(i3,z,t)  =e= sum{j$INDtoCOM(i3,j),LBS(j,z,t)*WC(j,z,t)};
4534   
4535   EQ104(i3,z,t)..   CKBS(i3,z,t)  =e= sum{k,sum{j$INDtoCOM(i3,j),KBS(k,j,z,t)*RC(j,z,t)}};
4536   
4537   EQ105(i3,z,t)..   MARKUP(i3,z,t) =e= {PC(i3,z,t)*XDBS(i3,z,t)-CLBS(i3,z,t)-CKBS(i3,z,t)}*switch(i3,z,t) ;
4538   
4539  *================================================================================
4540  * 6 Labour Supply
4541  *================================================================================
4542   EQ106(z,t)..  LS(z,t) =e= LST(z,t) *((W(z,t)/PIXCON(z,t)) / (W_lag(z,t)/PIXCON_lag(z,t)))**elasLS(z);
4543   
4544  *==============================================================================
4545  * 7 PERMET
4546  *==============================================================================
4547   EQ107(j,z,t).. PERMIT(j,z,t) =e= sum(ene, CO2FACTOR2(ene,j,z,t)*DE(ene,j,z,t));
4548   
4549   EQ108(z,t)..  PERMIT_TOTAL(z,t) =E=  sum(j,PERMIT(j,z,t))  ;
4550   
4551  *==============================================================================
4552  *   8 Carbon Tax Revenue Recycling
4553  *==============================================================================
4554  EQ109(z,t)..     REBATE(z,t) =e= TCTAX(z,t);
4555   
4556  EQ110(j,z,t)..   TIW_Share(j,z,t) =e= LD(j,z,t)/SUM(jj,LD(jj,z,t));
4557   
4558  EQ111(j,z,t)..   LaborRebate(j,z,t) =e= TIW_Share(j,z,t) * TCTAX(z,t) * recycle_labor(z,t);
4559   
4560  EQ112(j,z,t)..   TIK_Share(j,z,t) =e= KD('cap',j,z,t)/SUM(jj,KD('cap',jj,z,t));
4561   
4562  EQ113(j,z,t)..   ttik('cap',j,z,t) =e= ttik_lag(j,z,t) + deltatik(j,z,t);
4563   
4564  EQ114(j,z,t)..   deltatik(j,z,t) =e= -TIK_Share(j,z,t)*REBATE(z,t)/(R('cap',j,z,t)*KD('cap',j,z,t))*recycle_capital(z,t);
4565   
4566  EQ115(j,z,t)..   TIP_Share(j,z,t) =e= XST(j,z,t)/SUM(jj,XST(jj,z,t));
4567   
4568  EQ116(j,z,t)..   ttip(j,z,t) =e= ttip_lag(j,z,t) + deltatip(j,z,t);
4569   
4570  EQ117(j,z,t)..   deltatip(j,z,t) =e= -TIP_Share(j,z,t) * REBATE(z,t) / (PP(j,z,t)*XST(j,z,t))*recycle_ptax(z,t);
4571   
4572  *==============================================================================
4573  * 6 Numerical resolution to compute A_VA, sh0, G, G_REAL and IND
4574  *==============================================================================
4575  option cns = conopt4;
4576  *option cns = path;
4577  *option cns = minos;
4578   
4579  *option conopt4.TolPiv = 1e-6;
4580  *option iterlim = 100;
4581  *option reslim = 1000;
4582  *option iterlim = 0;
4583  *option lmmxsf = t ;
4584   
4585  *Eliminating display of solution makes it easier to check whether model solves
4586  *and to identify year when it crashes.
4587  *option profile=1;
4588  *option profile=3;
4589  *option profiletol=10;
4590   
4591  *Fast solve option
4592  option profile=0;
4593  option limrow=0, limcol=0, solprint = off;

